### Создать семью
POST {{host}}/api/v1/family
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Семья Ивановых",
  "timezone": "Asia/Yekaterinburg"
}

### Получить текущую семью
GET {{host}}/api/v1/family
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Добавить ребёнка
POST {{host}}/api/v1/family/members
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "login": "child@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "display_name": "Арсений"
}

### Список участников
GET {{host}}/api/v1/family/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Вход ребёнка
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "login": "child@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ребёнок видит семью
GET {{host}}/api/v1/family
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{childToken}}

### Ребёнок не может добавить участника
POST {{host}}/api/v1/family/members
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{childToken}}

{
  "login": "second-child@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "display_name": "Второй ребёнок"
}
